abstract: "Python service-catalog toolkit built on an XML schema (clinamenic_service.xml) — parses packages, tiers, retainers, and flat/recurring/tiered pricing into dataclasses, then validates IDs and exports JSON, CSV, D3.js graph data, and matplotlib price-comparison charts from one CLI."
